      <div
        class="post-container  "
      >
        <img
          class="post-container__blank"
          src="https://z.autoimg.cn/bbs/pc/detail/img/topic-blank.png"
          alt=""
        />
          <div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1241px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M04/F4/35/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpVml3IM6AVGifAAX0XIpiirg895.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1378px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M0B/F4/33/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpVWl3IM6Adux2AAT2YslLJhM232.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1263px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g34/M09/F0/1A/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpWGl3IM6AJaW4AATlN6fHDgE066.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1448px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M05/F4/35/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpVml3IM-AHYkKAAVsoYTDaUE582.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1252px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M0A/F4/43/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_Chto52l3IM-AJy-rAAUZVrA65X8008.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1233px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M04/F4/33/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpVWl3IM-AZyA_AAVdeMKuMoQ563.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1451px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M00/F4/36/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpVml3IM-AOQKiAAWKk3VsMN0489.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1259px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g33/M05/F4/33/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpVWl3INCAL_vRAAXDKysySZQ053.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="img-s"></div><div class="tz-picture"><img src="//z.autoimg.cn/fe/common/image/blank.gif" style="height: 1446px; width: 820px;" data-src="//club2.autoimg.cn/album/g34/M00/F0/1A/userphotos/2026/01/26/16/820_ChxpWGl3IM-AIdm0AAS46k6AEi0273.jpg" data-lazy="true"></div><div layer1="img-e"></div><br><div layer1="text-s"></div><div class="tz-paragraph">C10原车自带的四向记录仪很好用，但引用的是360环视的鱼眼摄像头，四合一素材分辨率和清晰度有所欠缺。被强行加塞、被迫踩了几次急刹车后，决定给车子增加一个高清前录，在四向泛记录基础上，再多一个记录辅助，代价是前挡风玻璃要占用一个小空间。即便百元产品在白天都很厉害，主要测试的是夜间场景：<br>①低速行驶拍路边停车车辆，号牌清晰<br>②60时速，他车超我车，号牌清晰<br>③70时速，我方超他车，号牌清晰<br>④相对时速超过35km以上，号牌模糊<br>⑤相对距离超过10m（目测），号牌模糊<br>⑥低速远光灯会车，号牌清晰<br>-----------<br>总体来讲a810pro的hdr算法还是不错，能当好一个好的辅助角色，美中不足是下载速度太慢了，2.4gwifi不够看。预算足的车友建议看看威孚的长焦双摄前录，5g下载速度，价格小贵</div><div layer1="text-e"></div><br>
      </div>
      
